    {
      "cn_text": "例如，他提出理论认为，一名担心显得对犯罪过于宽容的法官，如果当天已经判处五六名其他被告仅接受强制社区服务，可能更倾向于将某人判入狱。",
      "en_text": "For example, he theorised that a judge fearful of appearing too soft on crime might be more likely to send someone to prison if he had already sentenced five or six other defendants only to forced community service on that day.",
